  <sys:String x:Key="Text.InformationalEventsIncludingNtfs98ForHealthyVolumes" xml:space="preserve">Informational events (including NTFS 98 for healthy volumes) and events without known rules are ignored. Historical events trigger Attention, not an automatic diagnosis of a current fault.</sys:String>
